# Clip files are LOCAL artifacts, never committed. Synthetic clips are
# regenerated on demand (`scia-harness corpus synth`); clips rendered offline
# from downloaded source audio are re-rendered from their source. The committed
# record is `../manifest.toml`: each entry's provenance (source_url +
# audio_sha256 + segment + gain_db + render_cmd) plus the feature-clip `sha256`
# is enough to reproduce the exact bytes and verify them
# (`scia-harness corpus verify`).
#
# Ignore every clip file in this directory; keep only this .gitignore.
*
!.gitignore
